WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.901
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.102
We have such a big show
for you tonight.

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:05.205
And you know what?
Today is Thanksgiving.

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:08.808
It's my favorite part of this
holiday is eating the leftovers.

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:12.178
I actually have some
in "The Tonight Show" freezer.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.413
If you guys don't mind,

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:14.747
I'd just like to help myself
really quick.

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:16.583
I'll only take a second.
I'm sorry about this.

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:21.287
[ Dramatic music playing ]

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:23.556
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.691
-"Freezer Secrets."

00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:29.629 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:32.232
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:33.733
[ Pounding ]

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:34.934
Oh, no!

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.535
I'm stuck!

00:00:36.535 --> 00:00:40.172
Someone! Someone help!

00:00:40.172 --> 00:00:41.908
I'm stuck in the freezer!

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:44.244
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:46.779
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:50.150
It's no --

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:54.020
It's no --
[ Laughs ]

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.221
Okay. Wait, wait.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.557
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:00:57.557 --> 00:01:00.493
-Alright! Alright! Alright!

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:03.296
I'm stuck in the freezer.
-It's no --

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:05.264
It's no use, Jimmy.
-Cher!

00:01:05.264 --> 00:01:06.733
What are you doing here?

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:10.537
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:12.272
-I was trying
to get away from you!

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:14.040
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:17.009
-Great. Now we're trapped
inside this soundproof freezer.

00:01:17.009 --> 00:01:18.177
We're doomed.

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:20.079
-Well, okay,
but since this might be the end,

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:23.483
I have a few secrets
I have to get off of my chest.

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:24.284
-Same.

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:27.019
[ Heartfelt music playing ]

00:01:27.019 --> 00:01:28.521
You know when you're updating
your phone

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:30.089
and it says
"Terms and Conditions"?

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:31.791
-Mm-hmm.
-Well, I actually read

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.426
all the terms and conditions
before I click "accept."

00:01:34.426 --> 00:01:38.431
It takes like three hours,
but I think it's worth it.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:41.401
-You know my song
if "I Could Turn Back Time"?

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:44.236
-Of course it's --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:44.236 --> 00:01:45.471
It's a classic.

00:01:45.471 --> 00:01:47.039
-Well, I wrote it
when I found out

00:01:47.039 --> 00:01:48.775
I was going to be booked
on your show.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:52.311
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:54.012
-That song has a new meaning
to me.

00:01:54.012 --> 00:01:56.015
I have three confessions.

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:58.417
I shot JR.

00:01:58.417 --> 00:02:00.886
I let the dogs out.

00:02:00.886 --> 00:02:02.088
And I know where Waldo is.

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:05.057
He's at a Bed Bath &amp; Beyond
in New Jersey.

00:02:05.057 --> 00:02:06.826
[ Laughter ]
-Okay.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.794
Alright, I have one.

00:02:08.794 --> 00:02:12.765
When I go to a hotel,
I check in under an alias

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:15.168
so that no one knows me.
-Wow.

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:17.003
What name do you use?
-Jimmy Fallon.

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:20.606
-That's interesting.
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:02:20.606 --> 00:02:22.174
Know no one bothers you?

00:02:22.174 --> 00:02:23.475
-No.
-No.

00:02:23.475 --> 00:02:25.511
-No. They don't
even pay any attention to me.

00:02:25.511 --> 00:02:27.013
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:29.181
My family thinks I cook
the Thanksgiving turkey

00:02:29.181 --> 00:02:30.082
every year, but I don't.

00:02:30.082 --> 00:02:32.051
I just 3D print it.

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:35.121
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:38.057
-I've won an Oscar,
an Emmy, a Grammy.

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:40.192
I have multiple
platinum records,

00:02:40.192 --> 00:02:43.095
and I've sold out stadiums
all over the world.

00:02:43.095 --> 00:02:45.297
But I never got to do
the one thing I really,

00:02:45.297 --> 00:02:47.566
really wanted to do.

00:02:47.566 --> 00:02:48.835
-What is that?

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:51.804
-I wanted to ride
an Oscar Mayer Wienermobile.

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:53.505
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.505 --> 00:02:57.143
-Sorry. I'm so sorry.

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:59.612
-No, it's not a joke. It's sad.
-No. I know, I know, I know.

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:02.148
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:04.316
Let me tell you something
I never told anyone.

00:03:04.316 --> 00:03:06.186
I never did my own sketches
on "Saturday Night Live."

00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:07.419
-Do you want to hold my hand?
-Yeah.

00:03:07.419 --> 00:03:09.488
-Okay.
-I never did my own sketches

00:03:09.488 --> 00:03:11.057
on "Saturday Night Live."

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:13.959
When I got to showtime, I would
pass out from stage fright.

00:03:13.959 --> 00:03:16.629
Will Ferrell and Tracy Morgan
would puppet my body

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:17.930
"Weekend at Bernie's" style.

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:21.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:23.736
-It was probably an improvement.
-Yeah. [ Laughs ]

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:27.907
-My name isn't --
Actually, I hate to say this.

00:03:27.907 --> 00:03:32.578
My name isn't actually Cher.
-What?

00:03:32.578 --> 00:03:35.114
-It's pronounced "sure."

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:37.850
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.319
-Thank you for telling me,
"Sure."

00:03:39.319 --> 00:03:41.153
I wanna tell you something.

00:03:41.153 --> 00:03:43.589
I never learned
how to peel a banana,

00:03:43.589 --> 00:03:44.824
so I just eat them whole.

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:47.593
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.593 --> 00:03:50.529
[ Giggles ]

00:03:50.529 --> 00:03:52.965
-[ Laughs ] That's sad!
-It is. Yeah.

00:03:52.965 --> 00:03:55.034
The joke and the banana.

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:56.636
-Exactly.
-Okay.

00:03:56.636 --> 00:03:58.738 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:58.738 --> 00:04:00.039
-Do you have something
you want to tell me?

00:04:00.039 --> 00:04:02.308
-I do. Thank you.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:02.308 --> 00:04:05.011
Thank you for reminding me.
-No, no, no, no. we have time.

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:06.713
-I was overcome by the banana.

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:07.814
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:07.814 --> 00:04:11.751
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:13.453
I could show you if there's
any bananas in here.

00:04:13.453 --> 00:04:15.054
[ Laughter ]

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:18.224
-Okay.
You know my song "Believe"?

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:21.026
-Of course. That was --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:21.026 --> 00:04:24.463
It was the first song
to ever use Auto-Tune.

00:04:24.463 --> 00:04:25.664
-It's not Auto-Tune.

00:04:25.664 --> 00:04:27.967
It's just something
that I can naturally do

00:04:27.967 --> 00:04:31.737
with my voice
[tuned] anytime I want.

00:04:31.737 --> 00:04:35.374
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:35.374 --> 00:04:38.244
-Hey! Sure?

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:39.678
Sure's friend?

00:04:39.678 --> 00:04:41.881
-Oh, my gosh! Higgins!
We're saved!

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:44.583
What are you guys doing in here?
-No, he's my friend,

00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:46.819
and you have to stay here
with your bananas.

00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:49.822
-Wait, what?
No, no, I'm not going --

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:50.923
Wait, wait. Hold on, guys.

00:04:50.923 --> 00:04:54.127
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:58.564
[ Tuned ]
Happy Thanksgiving, everybody!

00:04:58.564 --> 00:05:00.266
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:03.135
-This has been
"Freezer Secrets."

00:05:03.135 --> 00:05:05.371
Stick around
for more "Tonight Show."

